%% Simplified screen matrix — auth gate plus the five core screens.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AuthGate : WASM boot → /auth/me
    AuthGate --> Login : unauthenticated
    AuthGate --> Home : authenticated
    Login --> Home : Microsoft OIDC (or Guest in Dev)

    Home --> WarRoom : stage duel
